    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d408-a6">

                <pb facs="0470" n="1148" xml:id="pg1148"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Gorogio</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">to</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pruyn</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure No. 6.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p>We have to inform your excellency that Sakai Oota No Kami has been appointed a
                    member of the Gorogio, and that he was instructed to take precedence over
                    ourselves.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">With respect and esteem, <date
                            calendar="gregorian japanese-nengō" when="1863-08-12">the 28th day of
                            the 6th month of the 3d year of Bunkin, (the 12th August,
                        1863</date>.)</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>MATSUDAIRA BOODZEN NO KAMI.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>MIDSUNO IDSUMI NO KAMI.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>ITAKURA SUWO NO KAMI.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>INOWUYE KAWATSI NO KAMI.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert H. Pruyn</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Minister Resident of the United States of America,
                            &amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
